            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上游版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Upstream latest is the pre-release {upstream}; you recorded {installed}. Whether to adopt a pre-release is your call.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Upstream latest is the pre-release {upstream}; you recorded {installed}. Whether to adopt a pre-release is your call."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上游最新为预发布版本 {upstream}，你记录的使用版本是 {installed}；预发布是否采用请自行判断。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Upstream latest is {upstream}; you recorded {installed}. Only minor version steps (about {steps}).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Upstream latest is {upstream}; you recorded {installed}. Only minor version steps (about {steps})."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上游最新为 {upstream}，你记录的使用版本是 {installed}，仅小版本更新（约 {steps} 个版本号段）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Upstream latest is {upstream}; you recorded {installed}. This spans about {steps} major version step(s); check compatibility.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Upstream latest is {upstream}; you recorded {installed}. This spans about {steps} major version step(s); check compatibility."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上游最新为 {upstream}，你记录的使用版本是 {installed}，包含主版本升级（约 {steps} 个版本号段），请核对兼容性。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UpstreamLens is an on-device tech-change radar: it monitors Release, Tag, and path commits of public GitHub repos and gives verifiable judgments based on your locally stored usage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UpstreamLens is an on-device tech-change radar: it monitors Release, Tag, and path commits of public GitHub repos and gives verifiable judgments based on your locally stored usage."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UpstreamLens 是本机使用的技术变化雷达：监控公开 GitHub 仓库的 Release、Tag 与指定路径的提交，结合本机保存的用途给出可核查的判断。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UpstreamLens only reads public info; a read-only token is enough. Grant permissions as needed:": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UpstreamLens only reads public info; a read-only token is enough. Grant permissions as needed:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UpstreamLens 只读取公开信息，给它一个只读令牌即可。按需授予权限："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UpstreamLens watches the GitHub repos you care about — Releases, Tags, and commits to specific files. When something changes you get a checkable signal, instead of refreshing pages.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UpstreamLens watches the GitHub repos you care about — Releases, Tags, and commits to specific files. When something changes you get a checkable signal, instead of refreshing pages."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UpstreamLens 盯着你在意的 GitHub 仓库——Release、Tag，以及指定文件的提交。有变化时给你一个可核查的信号，而不是让你反复刷页面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Upstreams sometimes publish content-addressed snapshots as releases or tags, which carry no version meaning. Turning this on keeps only entries that look like version numbers. If nothing qualifies, everything is kept so the source never goes silent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Upstreams sometimes publish content-addressed snapshots as releases or tags, which carry no version meaning. Turning this on keeps only entries that look like version numbers. If nothing qualifies, everything is kept so the source never goes silent."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上游有时会把内容寻址快照也做成 release 或 tag，这类条目没有版本含义。开启后只保留看起来像版本号的条目。若一条都不符合则全部保留，避免来源彻底不再提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
